
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Coisa HAS
    `móvel` IS A BOOLEAN
    @nlg:en movable

@ref REF-ABOVE-GIVEN
GIVEN c IS A Coisa
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en rule one
`regra um` c MEANS c's `móvel`

GIVEN c IS A Coisa
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref REF-AFTER-GIVETH
@nlg:en rule two
`regra dois` c MEANS c's `móvel`

@ref REF-ABOVE-GIVETH-CONSTANT
GIVETH A NUMBER
@nlg:en constant three
`constante três` MEANS 3
